{"updated":"2026-11-21T17:36:49.128Z","warnings":[{"country":"romania","level":2,"type":"Wind","event":"awareness_type=1, awareness_level=2","headline":"La munte, la altitudini în general de peste 1700 m, vântul va avea intensificări cu viteze la rafală de 80...100 km/h.\nSâmbătă (21 noiembrie) în nordul Carpaților Orientali, la altitudini în general mai mari de 1400 m, va ninge viscolit, se va depune strat de zăpadă de 5...10 cm, vântul va avea rafale cu viteze de 50...70 km/h, iar pe creste de 80...100 km/h. Vizibilitatea va scădea sub 100 m.","description":"In the mountain area, generally at altitudes above 1,700 metres, wind gusts will reach speeds of 80...100 km/h.\nOn Saturday (21 November), in the northern Orientali Carpathians, generally at altitudes above 1,400 metres, it will snow and will be blizzard. A snow layer of 5...10 cm will accumulate. Wind gusts will reach 50...70 km/h, and 80...100 km/h on mountain ridges. Visibility will drop below 100 metres.","instruction":"","sender":"National Meteorological Administration","web":"http://www.meteoromania.ro","onset":"2026-11-21T08:00:00.000Z","expires":"2026-11-22T18:00:00.000Z","areas":["Alba","Argeș","Bacău","Bihor","Bistrița-Năsăud","Brașov","Buzău","Caraș-Severin","Cluj","Covasna","Dâmbovița","Gorj"],"polys":[[[24.44,44.85,24.5,45.02,24.52,45.58,24.68,45.6,25.08,45.58,25.23,45.52,25.32,45.38,25.27,45.22,25.15,45.1,25.21,44.64,25.27,44.53,25.23,44.42,24.88,44.38,24.76,44.41,24.68,44.72,24.55,44.84,24.44,44.85]],[[26.44,46.04,26.26,46.25,26.27,46.32,26.02,46.42,26.05,46.52,25.98,46.7,26.36,46.66,26.88,46.79,27.21,46.77,27.3,46.7,27.49,46.16,27.29,46.2,26.91,46.07,26.44,46.04]],[[24.02,47.36,24.36,47.6,24.96,47.6,25.07,47.48,25.06,47.14,24.84,47.08,24.73,46.93,24.57,46.92,24.39,46.76,24.18,46.8,24.21,46.89,24.12,46.99,24.12,47.1,23.95,47.22,24.02,47.36]],[[24.68,45.6,24.67,45.77,24.74,45.93,24.95,46.08,25.17,46.17,25.45,46.1,25.55,46.03,25.59,45.83,26.01,45.62,26.09,45.52,26.07,45.51,25.93,45.5,25.86,45.44,